      "toNode": "mvt",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Subtract the secant line to equalize endpoint values · 减去割线，使端点等高"
    },
    {
      "id": "e29",
      "fromNode": "mvt",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "increment",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Bound the interior derivative to control the function change · 用内部导数界控制函数差"
    },
    {
      "id": "e30",
      "fromNode": "mvt",
      "fromSide": "top",
      "toNode": "monotonic",
      "toSide": "bottom",
      "label": "Apply on each subinterval to compare endpoint values · 对每个子区间应用，比较端点值"
    },
    {
      "id": "e31",
      "fromNode": "increment",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "ineq",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Bound the difference from a known reference value · 从已知基准值控制差函数"
    },
    {
      "id": "e32",
      "fromNode": "mvt",
      "fromSide": "top",
      "toNode": "taylor-rem",
      "toSide": "bottom",
      "label": "Higher-order mean-value arguments require extra smoothness · 更高阶中值论证需要额外光滑条件"
    },
    {
      "id": "e33",
      "fromNode": "derivative",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "differential",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "写成线性映射"
    },
    {
      "id": "e34",
      "fromNode": "differential",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "antiderivative",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Reverse differentiation / 反向寻找给定导数的函数"
    },
    {
      "id": "e35",
      "fromNode": "antiderivative",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "constant",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "One additive constant per interval / 每个区间一个加法常数"
    },
    {
      "id": "e36",
      "fromNode": "differential",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "substitution",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "du = g′(x) dx records the chain factor / 微分记录链式因子"
    },
    {
      "id": "e37",
      "fromNode": "constant",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "substitution",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Keep +C on each interval / 每段区间保留加法常数"
    },
    {
      "id": "e38",
      "fromNode": "antiderivative",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "ode",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Solve F′=f for the unknown function / 解给定导数的函数方程"
    },
    {
      "id": "e39",
      "fromNode": "ode",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "general-iv",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Separate the equation, its family and initial data · 区分方程、解族与初值"
    },
    {
      "id": "e40",
      "fromNode": "general-iv",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "separate",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "For a separable product structure, solve branch by branch · 对可分离乘积结构逐分支求解"
    },
    {
      "id": "e41",
      "fromNode": "substitution",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "separate",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Reverse the chain rule where the state factor is nonzero · 状态因子非零处反向使用链式法则"
    },
    {
      "id": "e42",
      "fromNode": "separate",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "lost-eq",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Division excludes the zero states of its factor · 除法排除因子为零的状态"
    },
    {
      "id": "e43",
      "fromNode": "lost-eq",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "max-interval",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Check continuation of every retained solution · 对保留的每条解检查延拓"
    },
    {
      "id": "e44",
      "fromNode": "separate",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "exp-growth",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Choose a constant proportional rate · 取固定比例变化率"
    },
    {
      "id": "e45",
      "fromNode": "exp-growth",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "logistic",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Make the per-capita rate decline linearly with the state · 让人均比例率随状态线性下降"
    },
    {
      "id": "e46",
      "fromNode": "separate",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "orthogonal-solve",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Apply if the resulting slope equation is separable · 所得斜率方程可分离时应用"
    },
    {
      "id": "e55",
      "fromNode": "orthogonal",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "orthogonal-solve",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Finite nonzero slopes permit the reciprocal ODE / 有限非零斜率时可写负倒数方程"
    },
    {
      "id": "e47",
      "fromNode": "singular",
      "fromSide": "top",
      "toNode": "max-interval",
      "toSide": "bottom",
      "label": "An undefined point on the trajectory blocks extension · 轨迹上的方程无定义处阻止延拓"
    },
    {
      "id": "e48",
      "fromNode": "singular",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "ode-check",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Report separate domain components · 分别报告定义域各分支"
    },
    {
      "id": "e49",
      "fromNode": "logistic",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "ode-check",
      "toSide": "left",
